WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
Even if it's just a clue

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:03,600
This favor cannot be taken lightly.

3
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:07,220
I also inquired about the market conditions

4
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:08,860
50 to 80 year old wild mountain body

5
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:09,820
As long as it's in good condition

6
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,380
We pay 1,500 yuan

7
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:12,780
If you are more than a hundred years old

8
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:14,700
Or the best Zi Lv of the same year

9
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,060
You can set the price as you wish

10
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:22,060
There are some in the space

11
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:29,530
But Secretary Li must not be exposed easily now.

12
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:30,450
Brother Gao

13
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:31,850
You praise me too much

14
00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:33,010
This kind of genius treasure

15
00:00:33,010 --> 00:00:34,450
That is undesirable

16
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:37,480
Where can you buy it if you have money?

17
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:39,360
I can't understand

18
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:40,640
If you print mountains in the future

19
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:43,200
Or maybe I heard something from a familiar old herb farmer.

20
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,400
Even if it's just a suspicion

21
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:46,930
Please also notify me as soon as possible

22
00:00:46,930 --> 00:00:47,970
Now that we have said this

23
00:00:47,970 --> 00:00:49,130
I won't hide it from you either

24
00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:51,570
I do know a few old herb collectors in the mountains.

25
00:00:51,570 --> 00:00:53,610
They may have a treasure at the bottom of the box

26
00:00:53,610 --> 00:00:54,690
I can help you find out

27
00:00:54,690 --> 00:00:58,170
But I would never dare to vouch for it

28
00:00:58,170 --> 00:00:59,170
Just try your best
